WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
because we stand for what is good,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.220
what is virtuous, what is noble.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.800
And to those trying to incite violence against us,

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.400
those trying to foment hatred against us, what do you have?

